# Copy to .env.local for local development.
# Authentication, Supabase, multiplayer, profiles, and cloud sync are deferred for this release.

# Sentry error monitoring (get the DSN from Sentry: project settings → Client Keys)
#
# Both hold the same value. NEXT_PUBLIC_ is what Next inlines into the browser
# bundle; the unprefixed one is read by the server and edge runtimes.
#
# Set these at BUILD time, not just at runtime: NEXT_PUBLIC_ values are inlined
# during the build and the CSP is baked into the routes manifest, so changing
# either one requires a redeploy rather than a restart.
#
# Leave the placeholders as-is. They are intentionally not a valid DSN, so an
# unconfigured environment fails loudly instead of quietly reporting nowhere.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SENTRY_DSN=<your-sentry-dsn>
SENTRY_DSN=<your-sentry-dsn>
